      <activity id="ac057750-5665-51dc-b7cd-61563a9ecb8a" activityNameId="a67efd57-b154-55bb-978a-3ed5fac85ca4" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Heat at electric storage heater, 5kW, CH certified electricity</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Heat at electric storage heater, 5kW, CH certified electricity
Heat from an electric storage heater at home, 5kW by using certified electricity mix. Efficiency assumed at 100%.;
Synonyms: Elektrospeicherofen / Nachtspeicher; 
UUID: 4483a3c0-12da-3bcf-94c7-6a8747603899
Share of the electric storage heater infrastructure (calculated with a lifetime of the heater of 20y and 2"100 hours of heating in a year) and electric energy input with an assumed efficiency of 100%.
Location: Data apply to the supply in Switzerland. Production occurs at AEG Haustechnik /  STIEBEL ELTRON GmbH &amp; Co. KG (DE).
Technology: Industry data.
Time period: Materials and energy use based on AEG  Nachtspeicherofen/ electric storage heater published in 2016. Report from: https://www.energie-experten.org/heizung/elektroheizung/speicherheizung/nachtspeicheroefen.html
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data provided by manufacturer 
Extrapolations: Data for Germany used with assumptions for Swiss energy supply.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_4483a3c0-12da-3bcf-94c7-6a8747603899.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
